{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42167","headline":"寄江都路员外 · 徐铉","name":"寄江都路员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾兄失意在东都，闻说襟怀任所如。\n已纵乖慵爲傲吏，有何关键制豪胥。\n县斋晓闭多移病，南亩秋荒忆遂初。\n知道故人相忆否，嵇康不得嬾修书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}